From 92f29eccb4a2c1384b59aac6fa8b53af20f0be3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arismoko <19542195+arismoko@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:21:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] CI: run the kept workflows without the fork's runner pool
 and gate

The daily legs and the hot-path trend no longer route through the fork's runner pool: jobs that need the prepared
vanilla data run on the horizon-game Linux runner (as ci.yml's vanilla-parity), the others on GitHub's runners.
The checks that only the fork's gate ran (the test tiers, the export-list and stand-in guards, the mod API surface
report) move into ci.yml's verify, and tools and tests that named the gate name ci.yml.
